## 🔥 Highlights & Vision

- 🚀 **[Fleet Highlights: Superhuman Narrow in Practice](HIGHLIGHTS.md)**  
  How non-experts direct AI agents to build domain-specific tooling for practical workflows -- featuring video & visual accompaniment for mobile DJs in an experimental C++ [`mixxxx` fork](https://github.com/sandraschi/mixxxxx) ([`mixx-dj-mcp`](https://github.com/sandraschi/mixx-dj-mcp)) and formal proofs via Lean 4 ([`leanforge-mcp`](https://github.com/sandraschi/leanforge-mcp)).

- 🔮 **[Coming Next: sandrafleetbot](COMING_NEXT.md)**  
  The free, sovereign GrokBot alternative -- running locally on consumer hardware (RTX 4090) at €0 per token with Muse Glimmer 30B, turning 190+ MCP servers into an autonomous agent tool surface.

→ **[Superhuman Narrow Manifesto](docs/SUPERHUMAN_NARROW.md)** • **[Workshop & Hardware](WORKSHOP.md)** • **[Shenzhen Robotics](docs/SHENZHEN_ROBOTICS.md)** • **[Bloopers](docs/BLOOPERS.md)**

